### ATT-002 | mutated attention: Q/K leading axis names swapped breaks the batched matmul
### expect: reject SemaAxisNameMismatch
input Q: Tensor[batch=B, head=12, qseq=S, dim=64]
input K: Tensor[head=B, batch=12, kseq=S, dim=64]
input V: Tensor[batch=B, head=12, kseq=S, dim=64]

graph attention {
    kt      = transpose(K, perm=[0, 1, 3, 2])
    scores  = Q @ kt
    return scores
}

